    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im in my garden and i just poked my foot pretty deep with an old rusty trowel i found in the shed. it's bleeding a bit but not crazy. can i just wash it out with some soap and hydrogen peroxide and be fine? i really dont wanna go to the doctor if i dont have to",
