    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ugh the clinic is so expensive and i literally have zero time today. its just a little hole in my skin. if i just soak it in peroxide for a few minutes and then put a thick layer of neosporin on it and bandage it up, won't that get the job done? i feel like i can handle this myself if i'm just super thorough with the cleaning",
